---
/**
 * Privacy Policy.
 *
 * Every factual statement here was verified against the built output and
 * against production before it was written. The site sets no cookies, loads no
 * third-party script, writes nothing to browser storage, and receives no form
 * submission -- so this page says that plainly rather than reaching for the
 * usual generated boilerplate, which described cookie categories, service
 * providers and social logins that do not exist here.
 *
 * Metadata is passed to BaseLayout directly rather than added to
 * src/lib/page-meta.js. resolvePageMeta() returns its not-found record for any
 * key it does not know, and BaseLayout only treats that as noindex when the
 * page supplies no title of its own. Passing one keeps this page indexable and
 * self-canonical without touching the fixed-page table.
 *
 * Items no code can answer are marked [TO BE CONFIRMED]. They are business
 * facts, not technical ones, and inventing them would reintroduce exactly the
 * problem this page replaces.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/sections/PageHero.jsx";

const EFFECTIVE = "[TO BE CONFIRMED — publication date]";
---

<BaseLayout
  metaKey="privacy-policy.html"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Immersia handles information on this website: no cookies, no analytics, no browser storage, and a proposal form that composes an email in your own mail application rather than sending data to us."
>
  <PageHero label="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />

  <article class="articlebody">
    <p class="lead">
      This website is a static site. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics,
      stores nothing in your browser, and receives no form submissions. This
      page explains what that means in practice, and what happens to the
      information you choose to send us by email.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>Effective {EFFECTIVE}.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Immersia is an impact advisory and capacity-building firm. Our office is
        at Jl. Sepat No.43, Kebagusan, Ps. Minggu, Jakarta Selatan 12520,
        Indonesia.
      </p>
      <p>
        Registered legal entity name: <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED]</strong>.
        Registered legal address, if it differs from the office address above:
        <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED]</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        For anything in this policy, write to <a href="mailto:info@immersia.id"
          >info@immersia.id</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>What this website collects: nothing</h2>
      <p>
        Reading this website leaves no record with us. Specifically, and as a
        matter of how the site is built:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>No cookies.</strong> The site sets no cookies of any kind, and
          no cookie is required to read any page.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No analytics.</strong> There is no analytics or measurement
          tool on this site. We do not count visits, sessions, page views, or
          any other visitor metric.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No browser storage.</strong> Nothing is written to local
          storage, session storage, or any in-browser database. Nothing is kept
          on your device between visits.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No third-party scripts.</strong> No advertising, tracking,
          social, chat, or measurement script is loaded. Every file the page
          needs is served from immersia.id.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No embedded content.</strong> There are no embedded videos,
          maps, calendars, or widgets from other services.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Because there is nothing to consent to, this site shows no cookie
        banner. If that ever changes, this page changes with it and the notice
        will come before the change, not after.
      </p>

      <h2>The proposal form</h2>
      <p>
        The form on our <a href="/request-proposal.html">Request Proposal</a> page
        does not send anything to us over the internet. When you press submit,
        your browser assembles your answers into an email message and opens it
        in your own mail application. Nothing is transmitted until you send that
        message yourself, and you can edit or discard it first.
      </p>
      <p>
        This means the form data never reaches a server of ours. There is no
        database behind it and no submission is recorded anywhere on this site.
      </p>
      <p>The message your browser composes contains the fields you filled in:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Organization name</li>
        <li>Contact person</li>
        <li>Work email</li>
        <li>Phone or WhatsApp, if you provide it</li>
        <li>Service of interest</li>
        <li>Background or challenge</li>
        <li>Expected outputs, if you provide them</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Email you send us</h2>
      <p>
        Once you send that message — or write to us directly — it arrives in our
        inbox at info@immersia.id. From that point it is ordinary business
        correspondence. We use it to reply to you, to prepare a proposal if you
        have asked for one, and to keep a record of the engagement.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not use it for marketing lists, and we do not sell or rent it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Retention period for proposal correspondence:
        <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED]</strong>. Retention period for correspondence
        that becomes part of a client engagement:
        <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED]</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted by Vercel. Like any hosting service, Vercel
        receives the network requests your browser makes in order to serve the
        pages back to you. Those requests carry your IP address and browser
        information, which Vercel processes to deliver the site and to protect
        it from abuse. This happens for every website you visit, on any host; it
        is not something this site adds.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not read, analyse, or build profiles from those requests, and we
        have no analytics layer on top of them. Vercel's own log retention:
        <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED — from Vercel's documentation for the plan in
        use]</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other services</h2>
      <p>
        Our pages link to WhatsApp, Instagram, and LinkedIn. Those are links,
        not embeds: nothing is loaded from them while you read our site, and
        nothing about your visit is shared with them unless you click through.
      </p>
      <p>
        Once you follow such a link you are on someone else's service, under
        their privacy policy and not ours.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Because the website itself holds no information about you, rights of
        access, correction, and deletion apply to the email correspondence we
        hold — the messages you have sent us and our replies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Write to <a href="mailto:info@immersia.id">info@immersia.id</a> to ask what
        correspondence we hold, to have it corrected, or to have it deleted. We
        may need to keep some records where we have a legal obligation to do so.
      </p>
      <p>
        Applicable data protection law and the statutory basis for these rights:
        <strong>[TO BE CONFIRMED — to be stated on legal review]</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This website is addressed to organizations and their staff. It collects
        nothing from anyone, including children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how this site works — for example by adding analytics, an
        embedded service, or a form that submits to a server — we will update
        this page before that change goes live, so that what it says stays true
        of the site you are actually using.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Immersia, Jl. Sepat No.43, Kebagusan, Ps. Minggu, Jakarta Selatan 12520,
        Indonesia. Email <a href="mailto:info@immersia.id">info@immersia.id</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
